      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Framing it as a minor detail would be an overreach, as the p-value directly challenges the *claim* of the result, not just the presentation. A \"conditional acceptance\" is plausible, but it must be explicitly contingent on the authors *re-analyzing the data using a robust, non-parametric test* to confirm the 95% claim. If they cannot confirm the significance with appropriate methods, the paper is not ready for high impact, regardless of the potential leap.",
